  <ModelName>Batch service with an additional time-controlled start</ModelName>
  <ModelDescription>The operator can serve up to 16 customers at the same time. A service request is triggered
either when 16 customers are waiting or when no customers have arrived for a certain period
of time (in order to limit the maximum wait time during batch formation if the operator is idle).</ModelDescription>
  <ModelAuthor>Alexander Herzog</ModelAuthor>
